# Normative machine-readable files of the KerML 1.0 and SysML 2.0
# specifications (metamodel 20250201) that `tools/fetch-spec-refs` places
# under spec-refs/. One file per line: SHA-256 of the file after its line
# ends are folded to LF, its path below spec-refs/, and the URL it is
# published at. Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.
